# Implementation Plan: AI Features Module

This document outlines the architecture for the **AI Features Module**, designed to give both Farmers and Buyers advanced, data-driven recommendations within the AgriChain platform.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> **AI Engine Architecture (Sandbox Mode):** Because we do not have a dedicated deep learning inference server (like a Python/TensorFlow microservice) running alongside our Rust backend in this sandbox, I will construct a highly robust **Heuristic AI Engine** directly in Rust. This engine will synthesize "AI-like" predictions (Confidence Scores, Price Recommendations, Demand Forecasting) by algorithmically analyzing the existing MongoDB dataset (historical orders, product inventory, ratings). 
> This perfectly fulfills the requirement of keeping the logic modular, as you can effortlessly swap out this internal heuristic engine with an external gRPC call to a real ML model in the future!

